      "quality_weight": 2.0,
      "provenance_note": "Pinned upstream CC0 dataset. Upstream README explicitly omits 17 songs with unresolved copyright risk; Orbitune admits only the pinned repository generation. Existing complete-song MIDI files are consumed directly; the single complete score without MIDI is converted from its pinned MuseScore source."
    },
    {
      "id": "muse_omr_benchmark",
      "tier": "supplement",
      "kind": "huggingface_score_snapshot",
      "license": "cc0-1.0",
      "commercial_safe": true,
      "repo_id": "musegroup/omr_benchmark",
      "revision_policy": "resolve-exact-at-install",
      "allow_patterns": ["*.mscz", "**/*.mscz", "benchmark_dataset.json"],
      "score_globs": ["*.mscz", "**/*.mscz"],
      "quality_weight": 2.0,
      "provenance_note": "Muse OMR Benchmark dataset card declares CC0-1.0 with Public Domain underlying works. The installer resolves the current Hub state exactly once to a 40-character SHA, downloads only symbolic MuseScore payload plus benchmark metadata, and persists that immutable revision in the source lock and install manifest. PDFs are excluded."
    },
    {
